{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Your Workout Into a Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored of the same old exercises? With <strong>Fitforce2</strong>, you\u2019re not just working out \u2014 you\u2019re playing. Smash through <strong>12 unique exercise</strong> moves across <strong>1,000+ stages</strong> packed with challenges, rewards, and pure fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get fit without even realizing you\u2019re sweating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Camera is Your Controller</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fancy gadgets. No bulky equipment. <strong>Just you and a camera</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To play on PC, you\u2019ll need to <strong>connect the Fitforce2 mobile app</strong> \u2014 your phone becomes the camera and motion tracker, sending your moves straight to the big screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC-only play is not available yet</strong>, but if you want to work out anywhere, you can always play the mobile version on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Workouts, Real Results</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve transformed <strong>12 proven workout moves</strong> \u2014 like squats, jumping jacks, and punches \u2014 into fast-paced mini-games that keep you moving and laughing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way to better health, then check your personalized performance summary \u2014 including <strong>calories burned</strong> and <strong>muscles worked</strong> \u2014 after <strong>every session</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Your Perfect Routine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from workout plans created by our expert trainers, or build your own for the ultimate customized challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019ve got <strong>5 minutes or 50</strong>, want <strong>low-impact exercises</strong> or aim to <strong>burn as many calories as possible</strong>, there\u2019s a plan for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for? Let\u2019s begin your perfect workout journey now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932290?t=1758182933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932290?t=1758182933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932290/e5c8c03095a869726d1408fb07d8ca28cf20c38b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758182933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932290/e5c8c03095a869726d1408fb07d8ca28cf20c38b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758182933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Your Workout Into a Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored of the same old exercises? With <strong>Fitforce2</strong>, you\u2019re not just working out \u2014 you\u2019re playing. Smash through <strong>12 unique exercise</strong> moves across <strong>1,000+ stages</strong> packed with challenges, rewards, and pure fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get fit without even realizing you\u2019re sweating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Camera is Your Controller</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fancy gadgets. No bulky equipment. <strong>Just you and a camera</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To play on PC, you\u2019ll need to <strong>connect the Fitforce2 mobile app</strong> \u2014 your phone becomes the camera and motion tracker, sending your moves straight to the big screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC-only play is not available yet</strong>, but if you want to work out anywhere, you can always play the mobile version on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Workouts, Real Results</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve transformed <strong>12 proven workout moves</strong> \u2014 like squats, jumping jacks, and punches \u2014 into fast-paced mini-games that keep you moving and laughing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way to better health, then check your personalized performance summary \u2014 including <strong>calories burned</strong> and <strong>muscles worked</strong> \u2014 after <strong>every session</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Your Perfect Routine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from workout plans created by our expert trainers, or build your own for the ultimate customized challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019ve got <strong>5 minutes or 50</strong>, want <strong>low-impact exercises</strong> or aim to <strong>burn as many calories as possible</strong>, there\u2019s a plan for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for? Let\u2019s begin your perfect workout journey now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Runnex Technology"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932290/a2c322dfac5f9198a6305012b56f4d08c30856b8/header.jpg?t=1758182933","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932290/868759736/600e0f8533cc611caa972eb4e4fff95fd27f1b4c/1756201578/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756202576","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932290/868759736/600e0f8533cc611caa972eb4e4fff95fd27f1b4c/1756201578/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756202576","highlight":true,"h